# CODEOWNERS — required review per PBK 7.
#
# Every change needs a review from the listed owners. The directory rules below
# mirror the service ownership model in SAPRS 11.6 / AIG 7: one capability, one
# owner set. Replace `@clydepro` with team handles as maintainers join; the
# architecture does not change when ownership does.

*                       @clydepro

# Architecture-sensitive surfaces need explicit sign-off (ADR required).
/docs/SAPRS/            @clydepro
/docs/adr/              @clydepro
/pyproject.toml         @clydepro
/uv.lock                @clydepro
/.github/               @clydepro

# Runtime subsystems.
/encore/playback/       @clydepro
/encore/services/       @clydepro
/encore/repositories/   @clydepro
/encore/events/         @clydepro
/encore/search/         @clydepro
/encore/domain/         @clydepro

# Offline builder (must stay decoupled from the server, ADR-001).
/apps/builder/          @clydepro
